**Step 2: Patch Deployment**
Now I need to patch the Deployment `app` to:
1.  Add `writable-data` volume (which is already there, so I just ensure it is there, though the previous patch should have handled this).
2.  Add `nginx-config` volume from the ConfigMap.
3.  Mount the `nginx-config` volume to `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` inside the container, overriding the default file.

I will update the deployment using a strategic merge patch.

**Patch payload:**
```json
{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "volumes": [
          {
            "name": "writable-data",
            "emptyDir": {}
          },
          {
            "name": "nginx-config",
            "configMap": {
              "name": "nginx-temp-config"
            }
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "volumeMounts": [
              {
                "name": "writable-data",
                "mountPath": "/var/data"
              },
              {
                "name": "nginx-config",
                "mountPath": "/etc/nginx/nginx.conf",
                "subPath": ""
              }
            ],
            "env": [
              {
                "name": "NGINX_TEMP_DIR",
                "value": "/var/data"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
